I am walking on the street.
Suddenly, the sky turns dark.
Today, the weather changes very fast.
The heavy rain starts again.
Five months ago, Mumbai was very dry!
This rain is indeed very intense.
I see a large building nearby.
That building is a museum.
I run quickly toward the gate.
I enter the museum compound.
I stand in its large entrance portico.
There is no rain here.
That portico is my excellent shelter.
I have an umbrella in my hand.
I close that umbrella.
I shake the umbrella to remove the water.
Now I step inside the museum.
